<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Rugby Union-Wales beat Ireland in under-21 match.</title>
<headline>Rugby Union-Wales beat Ireland in under-21 match.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales scored four tries in the final 15 minutes to beat Ireland 44-16 in Friday's under-21 international at Bridgend.</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377.</p>
</text>
